# ADR-lite doc records are source metadata and do not affect static semantics.
## @adr
## id: module-boundary
## status: accepted
## scope: module
## context: Module identity is compiler-visible.
## decision: Keep the source header canonical.
## consequences: Manifest metadata cannot rename the module.
mod spec.metadata

## @adr-lite
## id: function-boundary
## status: accepted
## scope: function
## context: Public functions define the static API boundary.
## decision: Keep annotations explicit at the public boundary.
## consequences: Callers observe the declared effect list.
pub fn main() -> Int effects []
  1
end
